When the Muslims arrived there, the Jewish king Marhab(مرحب) came out, asking for a duel.

755
00:52:04,824 --> 00:52:07,102
Amr Bin Akwah(عمرو بن أكوع) brother of Salamah Bin Akwah(سلمة بن الأكوع)

756
00:52:07,286 --> 00:52:12,973
went out to face him. Marhab(مرحب) struck Amr(عمرو) and his sword got stuck in Amr(عمرو)'s shield,

757
00:52:14,277 --> 00:52:17,640
in the same time Amr(عمرو) hit himself with his own sword and died.

758
00:52:18,299 --> 00:52:20,340
 Amr(عمرو) had a short sword.

759
00:52:21,086 --> 00:52:23,552
So when he went to stab Marhab(مرحب).

760
00:52:23,870 --> 00:52:26,281
 It came back and we hit him on the kneecap.

761
00:52:26,852 --> 00:52:28,352
And he ended up killing himself.

762
00:52:30,551 --> 00:52:33,504
Now, Salamah(سلمة), his brother heard some of the Sahabah(صحابه)

763
00:52:33,529 --> 00:52:36,437
saying that Amr(عمرو) has lost all of his deeds, he killed himself.

764
00:52:37,374 --> 00:52:39,614
So he went to the Messenger of Allah crying, and he said:

765
00:52:39,654 --> 00:52:41,439
Did my brother lose all of his deeds?

766
00:52:42,204 --> 00:52:44,563
 Rasool Allah ﷺ said: Who said that?

767
00:52:44,885 --> 00:52:46,314
He said: Some of your companions.

768
00:52:46,607 --> 00:52:49,169
Rasool Allah ﷺ said: No! They are wrong.

769
00:52:49,431 --> 00:52:51,336
Your brother gets double the reward.

770
00:52:53,075 --> 00:52:56,272
Now after Marhab(مرحب) killed Amir(عامر), he asked for another challenge.

771
00:52:56,312 --> 00:52:58,725
Rasool Allah ﷺ said: Who would go out to this man,

772
00:52:59,058 --> 00:53:00,748
Muhammad Ibn Maslima(محمد إبن مسلمة) said: I would.!

773
00:53:02,598 --> 00:53:06,316
I am the angry Avenger, Marhab(مرحب) killed my brother yesterday.

774
00:53:06,617 --> 00:53:08,435
Aamir(عامر) was his relative.

775
00:53:10,554 --> 00:53:13,606
The Messenger of Allah said: Then go! May Allah help you against him.

776
00:53:14,178 --> 00:53:17,642
When Muhammad(محمد), met with Marhab(مرحب) a tree came in their way.

777
00:53:19,134 --> 00:53:24,368
So now, Marhab(مرحب), and Muhammad Ibn Maslima(محمد إبن مسلمة) are revolving around this tree.

778
00:53:25,430 --> 00:53:32,180
And every time they would hit, try to make a strike, it would hit the tree.

779
00:53:33,261 --> 00:53:34,507
 So Ibn Nuhas(إبن نُحاس) says:

780
00:53:35,420 --> 00:53:38,398
 When Muhammad(محمد) met with Marhab(مرحب) a tree came in their way,

781
00:53:38,422 --> 00:53:42,088
 and each one of them would use it to seek protection from the other strike.

782
00:53:43,073 --> 00:53:47,015
And with every strike some of its branches and leaves would be cut,

783
00:53:47,063 --> 00:53:48,467
until none of them were left.

784
00:53:48,936 --> 00:53:51,046
 You know they're fighting around this tree and revolving,

785
00:53:51,436 --> 00:53:54,370
and they're cutting down the branches until all what you're left with, is trunk.

786
00:53:58,196 --> 00:54:02,529
Then Marhab(مرحب) charged, and struck him with his sword,

787
00:54:02,531 --> 00:54:06,648
Muhammad(محمد) shielded himself and Marhab(مرحب) sword was stuck in the shield,

788
00:54:07,013 --> 00:54:10,362
and he failed to pull it out, Muhammad(محمد) took advantage of that

789
00:54:10,712 --> 00:54:13,130
and cut off both his legs and left him.

790
00:54:14,311 --> 00:54:17,506
 Marhab(مرحب) begged the Muhammad(محمد) to kill him, but Muhammad(محمد) refused,

791
00:54:17,934 --> 00:54:23,305
he said: I won't, I want you to taste death like my brother did yesterday, and he walked away.

792
00:54:24,247 --> 00:54:26,536
 Later on, Ali(علي) passed by Marhab(مرحب) and finished him off.

793
00:54:26,818 --> 00:54:30,103
When Marhab(مرحب) was killed his brother Yaser(ياسر) asked for a duel

794
00:54:30,524 --> 00:54:32,500
 Az-Zubair Bin Awwam(ألزبير بن عوام) wents to face him.

795
00:54:33,509 --> 00:54:38,177
Safiyah(صفية), Az-Zubair(ألزبير)'s mother and the aunt of Rasool Allah ﷺ said: My son would be killed.

796
00:54:38,292 --> 00:54:39,046
سيقتل بي

797
00:54:39,570 --> 00:54:42,213
 Because Yaser(ياسر) and Marhab(مرحب) were well known.

798
00:54:42,888 --> 00:54:44,887
 So, Safiyah(صفية) said: He's going to kill my son.

799
00:54:45,165 --> 00:54:49,376
 Rasool Allah ﷺ said: In Sha Allah(إنْ شاءالله), your son will kill him, and he did.

800
00:54:49,816 --> 00:54:51,529
 Rasool Allah ﷺ opened Khaybar(خَيْبَر),

801
00:54:51,689 --> 00:54:56,882
 their fighting men were killed, their women and children enslaved, and their wealth was appropriated.

802
00:55:00,291 --> 00:55:02,091
24) The opening of Makkah.

803
00:55:03,580 --> 00:55:06,362
it occurred in Ramadan(رمضان) the eighth year of Hijrah(هجرة),

804
00:55:07,069 --> 00:55:13,228
 Rasool Allah ﷺ entered Makkah with an army of 10,000 with no fighting, except for a few skirmishes.

805
00:55:13,823 --> 00:55:15,408
 And it was a day of forgiveness.

806
00:55:15,908 --> 00:55:19,170
 On that day, he announced clemency for the people of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ),

807
00:55:19,575 --> 00:55:21,873
 who had fought him for over 20 years.

808
00:55:23,461 --> 00:55:24,704
25) Hunain(حنين)

809
00:55:26,974 --> 00:55:29,180
it occurred immediately after the opening of Makkah.

810
00:55:30,045 --> 00:55:34,181
The leader of how Hawazin(هوازن) Malik Bin Auf(مالك بن عوف) assembled a huge army from Hawazin(هوازن),

811
00:55:34,321 --> 00:55:40,143
Thaqeef(ثقيف), Nadhr(نذر), Jasm(جثم) and Saad Bin Bakr(سعد بن بكر).

812
00:55:41,530 --> 00:55:43,377
Rasool Allah ﷺ went out to fight them.

813
00:55:43,972 --> 00:55:47,833
When the Muslims were passing through the valley of Hunain(حنين), they were ambushed by the enemy.

814
00:55:49,210 --> 00:55:52,732
 The entire Muslim army went into disarray.

815
00:55:53,653 --> 00:55:58,683
And they fled, with the exception of a small number of Sahabah(صحابه), who surrounded the Messenger of Allah.

816
00:55:59,308 --> 00:56:03,007
 They started out an army of 12,000.

817
00:56:03,468 --> 00:56:07,650
10,000, who opened Makkah 2000 new Muslims from Makkah.

818
00:56:07,905 --> 00:56:11,642
So the total number was 12,000, that's when they were very impressed with their numbers,

819
00:56:11,667 --> 00:56:12,300
they said:

820
00:56:12,325 --> 00:56:13,499
لن نغلب اليوم على قلة

821
00:56:13,523 --> 00:56:15,928
We're not going to lose because of lack of numbers.

822
00:56:17,330 --> 00:56:23,714
 These 12,000 ran away in front of the army of Hawazin(هوازن)

823
00:56:24,656 --> 00:56:30,404
 the only ones, who stood behind are Rasool Allah ﷺ with 80 of his Sahabah(صحابه).

824
00:56:31,319 --> 00:56:34,793
And this army of 80, is the army that defeated Hawazin(هوازن).

825
00:56:36,071 --> 00:56:37,561
 It's not the 12,000 it's 80.

826
00:56:38,539 --> 00:56:41,676
And not all of them were old muslims, Al-Abbas(العباس) was a new Muslim.

827
00:56:42,918 --> 00:56:47,751
If we're going to consider him to be new, but he might have been Muslim in Makkah for some time.

828
00:56:49,017 --> 00:56:53,740
Rasool Allah ﷺ told his Uncle Al-Abbas(العباس), who had a loud voice to call Al-Ansaar(اَلْاَنْصَار),

829
00:56:54,248 --> 00:56:57,856
they came from every direction, and fought furiously.

830
00:56:59,085 --> 00:57:01,587
 After a short while the enemy was defeated,

831
00:57:01,984 --> 00:57:08,710
the booty was 24,000 camels, 40,000 sheep, and a large amount of silver.

832
00:57:10,586 --> 00:57:14,316
26) At-Taef(اَلطَّائِف), it was during Shawal(شوال) the eighth year of Hijrah(هجرة),

833
00:57:14,329 --> 00:57:17,528
after the defeat of Thaqeef(ثقيف), during the Battle of Hunain(حنين),

834
00:57:17,536 --> 00:57:21,110
they went back to their town, At-Taef(اَلطَّائِف) and closed its gates.

835
00:57:21,864 --> 00:57:24,396
Rasool Allah ﷺ followed them and camped close by,

836
00:57:25,230 --> 00:57:27,166
laying a severe siege on them.

837
00:57:27,484 --> 00:57:30,719
The people of Thaqeef(ثقيف) attacked the Muslims with a shower of arrows.

838
00:57:31,307 --> 00:57:34,163
 When it became apparent that the Thaqeef(ثقيف) won't fall easily.

839
00:57:34,846 --> 00:57:37,834
Rasool Allah ﷺ sought counsel from his Sahabah(صحابه).

840
00:57:38,382 --> 00:57:41,186
Nofal(نوفل) said: Thaqeef(ثقيف) are like a fox in the hole.

841
00:57:41,964 --> 00:57:46,764
If you stay at it, you will get it and if you leave it, it won't harm you.

842
00:57:47,720 --> 00:57:49,236
 So Rasool Allah ﷺ decided to leave.

843
00:57:51,498 --> 00:57:56,900
And that's shower of arrows, one of those arrows hit Abdullah Bin Abi Bakr(عبدالله بن أبي بكر).

844
00:57:58,210 --> 00:58:03,296
It didn't kill him instantaneously, he only died when his father was Khalifah(خليفه).

845
00:58:05,217 --> 00:58:11,015
When the delegation of At-Taef(اَلطَّائِف), who were already Muslim, came to meet the Khalifah(خليفه), Abu Bakr(ابوبكر).

846
00:58:12,549 --> 00:58:15,786
 Abu Bakr(ابوبكر) pulled out that arrow, the arrow that killed his son Abdullah(عبدالله).

847
00:58:16,636 --> 00:58:18,500
And he showed it to the delegation.

848
00:58:18,533 --> 00:58:21,117
He said: Does anybody know who this arrow belongs to.?

849
00:58:22,229 --> 00:58:24,816
So one of them held the arrow and said this arrow belongs to me.

850
00:58:25,269 --> 00:58:27,692
I sharpened it, and I'm the one who fired it.

851
00:58:28,978 --> 00:58:31,766
Abu Bakr(ابوبكر) said: That is the arrow that killed my son.

852
00:58:33,020 --> 00:58:40,298
So the man said: Al-hamdulillah(ألحمدلله), who gave your son martyrdom through me,

853
00:58:40,837 --> 00:58:43,424
 and Al-hamdulillah(ألحمدلله) who guided me after that, to Islam.

854
00:58:45,807 --> 00:58:47,331
Number 27) Tabook(تبوك)

855
00:58:51,268 --> 00:58:53,470
It occurred in Rajab(رجب) ninth of Hijrah(هجرة).

856
00:58:53,975 --> 00:58:57,762
This was the last army Rasool Allah ﷺ participates in.

857
00:58:58,638 --> 00:59:01,724
The Messenger of Allah, marched into Roman territory,

858
00:59:02,177 --> 00:59:06,454
when he heard that they are gathering an army to attack Madina.

859
00:59:07,534 --> 00:59:10,757
The Muslims made their move in a very difficult time.

860
00:59:11,659 --> 00:59:13,795
It was a year of drought, poverty.

861
00:59:14,447 --> 00:59:19,069
It was right before the time of harvest and it was during hot season,

862
00:59:19,752 --> 00:59:24,299
the hypocrites stayed behind and their hypocrisy was exposed in Surah At-Toba(سورة التوبة).

863
00:59:25,371 --> 00:59:28,443
The Muslims assembled an army of 30,000, strong,

864
00:59:29,166 --> 00:59:32,171
 the largest army ever assembled by the Messenger of Allah.

865
00:59:33,180 --> 00:59:36,054
Due to poverty some Sahabah(صحابه) came to the Messenger of Allah,

866
00:59:36,063 --> 00:59:38,990
urging him to supply them in order for them to join the army.

867
00:59:40,157 --> 00:59:42,712
When he told them that he has no finances for them.

868
00:59:43,038 --> 00:59:47,587
 They left with tears flowing from their eyes, for not being able to join the army.

869
00:59:48,858 --> 00:59:53,348
The Roman emperor was stationed in Hims(حمص) at the time in order to prepare for war.

870
00:59:53,897 --> 00:59:56,594
 He assembled an army of Romans and Christian Arabs.

871
00:59:57,547 --> 01:00:01,299
 When they heard of the Muslim army they decided not to fight.

872
01:00:01,974 --> 01:00:06,142
 Rasool Allah ﷺ waited in Tabook(تبوك) for 10 days when the Romans did not show up,

873
01:00:06,278 --> 01:00:07,468
he returned to Madina.

874
01:00:07,897 --> 01:00:11,257
After he established his presence in the lower parts of Ash-Sham(ألشَّام)

875
01:00:11,676 --> 01:00:13,967
and Northern Arabia.

876
01:00:14,626 --> 01:00:17,460
 If you look at the number of battles that Rasool Allah ﷺ fought

877
01:00:17,520 --> 01:00:20,442
 and divide them by the years he spent in Madina.

878
01:00:20,853 --> 01:00:23,473
It comes out to about two to three battles, a year.

879
01:00:24,439 --> 01:00:25,344
That's a lot!

880
01:00:25,922 --> 01:00:29,342
Tayeb(طيِّب) In Sha Allah(إنْ شاءالله), we'll end with that,

881
01:00:29,350 --> 01:00:32,669
and next week we'll start talking about the Sarayah(سراية),

882
01:00:33,621 --> 01:00:34,782
talk about the Sarayah(سراية).

883
01:00:36,233 --> 01:00:39,920
Questions, otherwise we'll take tea break.

884
01:00:41,492 --> 01:00:55,469
Question From Audience:

885
01:01:00,010 --> 01:01:05,550
It's happened in Harub(حروب) of Ar-Riddah(ردَّة) the Muslims,

886
01:01:06,897 --> 01:01:08,575
this was with Al-Alaa Bin Hadhrami(ألأعلى بن حزرمي),

887
01:01:09,456 --> 01:01:11,606
Al-Alaa Bin Hadhrami(ألأعلى بن حزرمي) was one of the Owliyaa(أولياء) of Allah.

888
01:01:12,219 --> 01:01:13,720
Many Karamaat(كرامات) happened with him.

889
01:01:14,052 --> 01:01:15,328
He was in the time of Abu Bakr(ابوبكر).

890
01:01:17,022 --> 01:01:18,940
He is the one, who walked over water.

891
01:01:20,304 --> 01:01:23,926
And he is the one, who may Dua(دُعَا), when their camel were lost,

892
01:01:23,989 --> 01:01:26,233
and the camels just came, peacefully back.

893
01:01:27,148 --> 01:01:30,962
And when they were in the land that had many scorpions and spiders and snakes.

894
01:01:31,712 --> 01:01:33,488
He made an announcement he said:

895
01:01:33,524 --> 01:01:35,652
We are the messengers of the Messenger of Allah and they all left.

896
01:01:36,634 --> 01:01:38,188
He was a man of Karamat(کرامات),

897
01:01:38,474 --> 01:01:42,019
 Al-Alaa Bin Hadhrami(ألأعلى بن حزرمي), he camped next to the enemy.

898
01:01:43,606 --> 01:01:46,025
So at night he was hearing these loud voices,

899
01:01:46,054 --> 01:01:48,477
 he told one of his men to go and spy on them,

900
01:01:48,528 --> 01:01:49,790
he said: They're drunk.

901
01:01:50,909 --> 01:01:52,150
He said: Lets make our move.

902
01:01:52,547 --> 01:01:53,474
 They attacked at night.

903
01:01:55,068 --> 01:02:02,461
So, one of their leaders, he ran out of his tent,

904
01:02:02,548 --> 01:02:06,818
and he jumped over his horse, but the stirrup of the horse,

905
01:02:06,876 --> 01:02:07,921
where you put your feet.

906
01:02:08,988 --> 01:02:11,635
It fell down or something or it broke.

907
01:02:12,479 --> 01:02:12,962
So he said:

908
01:02:12,977 --> 01:02:14,257
من يصلح لي رقابي

909
01:02:14,269 --> 01:02:15,299
 Who will fix it for me.

910
01:02:15,949 --> 01:02:17,493
So one of the Muslims, who was next to him.

911
01:02:17,508 --> 01:02:19,116
 He said: I will fix it for you.

912
01:02:19,615 --> 01:02:21,879
He said: Lift up your leg, lift your leg,

913
01:02:21,904 --> 01:02:22,985
 so that he could fix it.

914
01:02:23,007 --> 01:02:26,723
 Lift you leg! So he lifted his leg, he chopped off, he cut off his leg.

915
01:02:27,731 --> 01:02:33,142
 He said: I could hear the sound of the sword on the bone.

916
01:02:34,039 --> 01:02:35,716
 So the man fell off his horse.

917
01:02:36,387 --> 01:02:38,224
So he told the Muslim to come and kill him.

918
01:02:38,249 --> 01:02:42,110
 He said: I'm gonna leave you, the way you are.

919
01:02:43,010 --> 01:02:45,619
And whenever one of the Muslims soldier will pass next to him.

920
01:02:45,627 --> 01:02:48,950
He would say: Please kill me! Please kill me!

921
01:02:48,973 --> 01:02:49,903
 And they would all leave him.

922
01:02:50,166 --> 01:02:52,789
Until one of the Muslims passed next to him,

923
01:02:52,804 --> 01:02:53,430
he said: Please kill me!

924
01:02:53,454 --> 01:02:54,556
He said: Alright! Fine,

925
01:02:54,578 --> 01:02:55,067
I'll kill you.

926
01:02:55,194 --> 01:02:55,738
He killed him.

927
01:02:56,749 --> 01:02:57,321
And then he said:

928
01:02:57,346 --> 01:02:59,114
When I saw his leg laying next to him,

929
01:02:59,359 --> 01:03:01,134
 I regretted that I killed him.

930
01:03:01,589 --> 01:03:03,551
 He didn't know that he was bleeding.

931
01:03:05,355 --> 01:03:09,874
So, this does happen, in battle.

932
01:03:09,886 --> 01:03:16,416
But see with the sharpening the sword.

933
01:03:17,138 --> 01:03:18,666
That's for execution.

934
01:03:19,958 --> 01:03:27,352
The execution is different executions should be done in the most compassionate way

935
01:03:27,860 --> 01:03:33,043
unless, again, these specific people need to be brutally killed.

936
01:03:34,768 --> 01:03:36,902
 But in battle that's different.

